{"id":"fea02b696529d019","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-bounded-axiomatizability.md","title":"Bounded Sets and Essential Infinitude","display":"df-bounded-axiomatizability — Bounded Sets and Essential Infinitude","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability","aliases":["67-df-bounded-axiomatizability"],"display":"df-bounded-axiomatizability — Bounded Sets and Essential Infinitude","depends_on":["[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":4,"source_label":"finite extension, essentially infinite, bounded set","source_printed_pages":"52–53","source_pdf_pages":"63–64","source_proof_status":"定义陈述已核对；不涉及定理证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-bounded-axiomatizability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-bounded-axiomatizability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-axiomatizability — Bounded Sets and Essential Infinitude"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"finite extension, essentially infinite, bounded set"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"52–53"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"63–64"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"定义陈述已核对；不涉及定理证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(S,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>。可推导性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 是固定逻辑矛盾句；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\nvdash\\bot\">\\(U\\nvdash\\bot\\)</span> 是外部一致性。对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的量化不预设它们递归可枚举。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(U,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(U,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n:n\\ge1\\}\\ (X\\subseteq\\Gamma),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(U,S)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(U\\vdash\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow S\\cup\\{\\theta\\}\\vdash\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\forall\\theta\\in T\\ U\\vdash\\theta\\bigr)\\land U\\nvdash\\bot\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(U,S)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n:n\\ge1\\}\\ (X\\subseteq\\Gamma),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(U,S)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(U\\vdash\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow S\\cup\\{\\theta\\}\\vdash\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\forall\\theta\\in T\\ U\\vdash\\theta\\bigr)\\land U\\nvdash\\bot\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(U,S)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>“有界”约束公理的统一算术复杂度，不约束代码大小或公理数量。有限公理可合取为一个句子，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteOver}\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteOver}\\)</span> 与有限多新公理的表述相应。</p>\n<p>本质无限量化所有一致扩张；它不是仅说原呈示有无限多个公理，也不只排除原呈示可有限删减。来源定义已逐项核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是公理集；$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$。可推导性取 [[67-df-prim-provability]]，$\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 是公理集；$X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$。可推导性取 [[67-df-prim-provability]]，$\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n$ 取 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"U\\nvdash\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(U,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\Gamma\\in\\{\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n:n\\ge1\\}\\ (X\\subseteq\\Gamma),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(U,S)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\ \\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(U\\vdash\\psi\\Longleftrightarrow S\\cup\\{\\theta\\}\\vdash\\psi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\forall\\theta\\in T\\ U\\vdash\\theta\\bigr)\\land U\\nvdash\\bot\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(U,S)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteOver}","display":false}],"bytes":2160,"backlinks":[{"id":"1b2d614db2eb3b87","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$，$S$ 一致且递归可枚举，$\\mathrm{Code}_g(X)\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_1$，$\\neg\\mathrm{FiniteOver}(S\\cup X,S)$；$\\mathrm{FiniteOver}$ 见 [[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]。"},{"id":"8dd4150b375026b2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{URefl}(S)$ 取 [[67-df-uniform-reflection]]；$\\mathrm{Bounded}(X)$ 取 [[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]。$X$ 可为非递归可枚举句子集。"},{"id":"8e071baceea3f74c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(S)$ 取 [[67-df-local-reflection]]；$\\mathrm{EssInfinite}(T,S)$ 取 [[67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]。固定点使用 [[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-bounded-axiomatizability]]"}],"outgoing":["851cd80e64893935","854772391cef4007","573b4c635ea6d91f"]}